  "comment": "International Mobile Telecommunications-2000 (IMT-2000) , better known as 3G or 3rd Generation , is a family of standards for mobile telecommunications defined by the International Telecommunication Union , which includes GSM EDGE , UMTS , and CDMA2000 as well as DECT and WiMAX . Services include wide-area wireless voice telephone , video calls , and wireless data, all in a mobile environment.",
